apprentice|PASS: Learning a skilled trade through experienced supervision fits the source noun. The hinge example supplies observation rather than certification law; apprentice and apprenticeship are distinguished without guessing employment status.
heating|PASS: Room-warming system/process is kept separate from general heat increase. Turned down is reduction, not switched off; the last-visitor sequence and usually uncountable grammar are preserved.
message|PASS: Noticeboard communication fits the broad source noun without requiring an electronic channel. Sender/topic complements are checked; the Vietnamese explanation of where to collect costumes preserves the communicative purpose.
possibility|REVIEW: A feasible option and something that may happen are combined under the broad source boundary. The courtyard example illustrates an option, not a probability estimate; possible sub-Sense splitting remains unresolved.
share|PASS: Joint use as a verb and allotted portion as a noun keep distinct source ordinals. The studio storage room need not be physically divided; equal supplies and with/of complement guidance are coherent.
